格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness Image2 生图插件，通过第三方 OpenAI Images 兼容接口调用 gpt-image-2，只需配置 baseURL 和 API Key。 | Image2 generation plugin for DeepSeek Harness via third-party OpenAI Images-compatible APIs.","id":"gh:1334519411","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-image2-draw","slug":"JuneLearn/dsh-image2-draw","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","gpt-image-2","image-generation","image-to-image","openai-images","text-to-image"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness Image2 生图插件，通过第三方 OpenAI Images 兼容接口调用 gpt-image-2，只需配置 baseURL 和 API Key。 | Image2"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" generation plugin for DeepSeek Harness via third-party OpenAI Images-compatible APIs."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Image2 Draw"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Unable to generate images directly in DeepSeek Harness? This plugin adds Image2\ngeneration through a"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" third-party relay that exposes an OpenAI Images-compatible\nAPI. Configure only a `baseURL` and an `"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"API Key`, then use `gpt-image-2` for\ntext-to-image and image-to-image tasks in chat."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文说明"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Third-party service recommendation (referral link)**\n>\n> If you are looking for an OpenAI-compat"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ible API relay, you can take a look at\n> WPIronman API. This is my\n> referral link, and I may receiv"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"e a referral benefit if you register through\n> it; any promotion or benefit is subject to the provid"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"er's current terms. This\n> plugin is independent of that service and does not require any particular"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"\n> relay. Evaluate pricing, reliability, and privacy terms before choosing a\n> provider.\n>\n> New use"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"rs can redeem the gift quota with code `99F509ABC6C38F77`."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Related project"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Need independent reasoning-effort controls for third-party models in DeepSeek\nHarness? See my other "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"plugin:\nDSH Reasoning Settings.\nIt configures reasoning levels, provider defaults, and API wire valu"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"es for\ncustom providers and models."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- Adds an **Image2 Draw** card under **Settings > Plugins > Configurable plugins**.\n- Requires only "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"a `baseURL` and an `API Key`; the default model is `gpt-image-2`.\n- Accepts a short base URL such as"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" `https://example.com/v1` and appends\n`/images/generations` automatically.\n- Derives the image-edit "},{"id":"p9s4","text":"endpoint as `/images/edits`, with an optional explicit\n`editURL` override.\n- Provides `image2-genera"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"te` for 1-8 sequential text-to-image generations.\n- Provides `image2-edit` with 1-8 PNG, JPEG, or We"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"bP reference images.\n- Supports adaptive portrait, landscape, and square sizes as well as validated\n"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"custom dimensions.\n- Displays generated images directly in the conversation with a dedicated tool\nca"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"rd for thumbnails, zoom, and Save As actions.\n- Resolves image attachments in the client card withou"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"t injecting image content\ninto DeepSeek model context that does not support vision input.\n- Also sav"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"es images under `outputs/image2/` in the current session working\ndirectory and numbers duplicate nam"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"es instead of overwriting files.\n- Stores API keys only in DSH credentials. Keys never enter the reg"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"ular settings\ndocument and are never returned by the plugin state endpoint.\n- Validates settings wri"},{"id":"p9s13","text":"tes, response sizes, timeouts, and input images. HTTP 524\nand timeout failures are not retried autom"},{"id":"p9s14","text":"atically, preventing duplicate\ncharges when the upstream service has already generated an image."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Live demo"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### In-conversation result"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Plugin settings"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- Install Node.js. DSH currently supports Node.js 22.19.x\nor version 24 and newer; Node.js 24 LTS is"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" recommended. Node.js includes `npm`\nand `npx`.\n- Install Git so the plugin can be fetched from GitH"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ub.\n- Install pnpm. Both methods require pnpm because `dsh plugin` invokes it in the\nprofile directo"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ry to install or remove plugins.\n- Your network must reach `registry.npmjs.org` and `github.com`. Co"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"nfigure a\nworking network proxy if npm or GitHub is unavailable or unstable.\n- Method 1 does not req"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"uire a DeepSeek Harness source checkout. Method 2\nadditionally requires that checkout."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Check the basic environment first:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"If `corepack enable` fails with a permission error, run it once from an\nAdministrator PowerShell. Al"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ternatively, use another option from the\npnpm installation guide."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"If downloads remain on a spinner or fail with `ECONNRESET`, `ETIMEDOUT`, or a\nGitHub connection erro"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"r, set a proxy for the current PowerShell window. Port\n`7890` is only an example; replace it with yo"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ur proxy's actual port:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"These variables only affect the current PowerShell window and disappear when it\nis closed."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Method 1: npx (recommended for regular users)"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"This method does not require a DeepSeek Harness source checkout or a global\n`dsh` installation, but "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"Git and pnpm must already be available. On its first\nrun, `npx` downloads `@deepseek-ai/dsh` and its"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" dependencies, which can take\nseveral minutes:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Start Web through the same package runner after installation:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Method 2: pnpm with the Harness source tree (recommended for developers)"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Use this method if you already cloned `deepseek-harness` and want to run its\nsource directly. First "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"confirm pnpm is available:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Enter the DeepSeek Harness source root. Install its dependencies once, then\ninstall the plugin:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Start Web from that source directory afterward:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The package's `dsh.bundle` declaration adds the plugin to the Web profile\nautomatically. Neither met"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"hod requires editing `cordis.patch.yml`. Web listens\non `http://127.0.0.1:3080` by default; it uses "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"another port only when the default\nis occupied or you explicitly select one."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### Upgrade"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Run the corresponding install command again to upgrade. No uninstall or\nprofile-patch maintenance is"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"rresponding install command again to upgrade. No uninstall or\nprofile-patch maintenance is required."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"npx method:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"pnpm source method:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"### Uninstall"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"npx method:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"pnpm source method:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"DSH removes both the dependency and its bundle layer. Restart `dsh web`; the\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"Built against the public dual-end plugin, settings namespace, credentials, tool\nregistration, client"},{"id":"p48s2","text":" slot, and WebServer lifecycle interfaces of DeepSeek\nHarness `0.1.0-rc.6`. Harness is still in Deve"},{"id":"p48s3","text":"loper Preview; if the plugin stops\nloading after an upgrade, check these interfaces and the `dsh.cli"},{"id":"p48s4","text":"ent.inject`\ndeclaration."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
